          <li>Longer conversation memory</li>
          <li>Early access to new features</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="goTo('login')">Choose Plus</button>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Max</div>
        <div class="plan-price">₹1,499<span class="per">/month</span></div>
        <div class="plan-gst">+ 18% GST</div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>Unlimited daily messages</li>
          <li>Top-priority response speed</li>
          <li>Extended context for long chats</li>
          <li>Direct support access</li>
        </ul>
        <button class="btn" onclick="goTo('login')">Choose Max</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="currency-note">prices shown in INR · billed monthly · cancel anytime</div>
  </section>

  <section class="bordered" id="security-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow-small">privacy &amp; security</span>
      <h2>Built with your privacy in mind</h2>
      <p>Here's exactly how your data is handled — plainly, with no fine print.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="security-grid">
      <div class="security-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="9" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 1 1 8 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Encrypted in transit</h3>
        <p>Every message travels over a secure HTTPS connection between your browser and the server.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="security-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2 4 6v6c0 5 4 8 8 10 4-2 8-5 8-10V6z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>No stored passwords on this demo</h3>
        <p>This preview doesn't run its own account database — nothing you type into the login screen is saved anywhere.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="security-card">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Picks up where you left off</h3>
        <p>Your chat is saved automatically so it's there next time — currently only while viewing inside Claude.ai, not yet on a separately hosted domain.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div>Max GPT — premium AI, priced for India.</div>
    <div class="support-line">Support: <a class="support-email" href="mailto:maxnaveed007@gmail.com">maxnaveed007@gmail.com</a></div>
  </footer>
</div>

<div id="view-login">
  <div class="login-card">
    <div class="brand brand-center">
      <div class="wordmark">MAX<span class="glyph">⌁</span>GPT</div>
      <span class="powered-tag">powered by maxnaveed</span>
    </div>
    <div class="login-sub">Log in to continue your unlimited chat</div>

    <div class="field">
